OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mainly dry
OL,6,Fand bright evening with perhaps just
OL,7,Fthe odd light shower. Cloud and
OL,8,Foutbreaks of rain then spreading east,
OL,9,Fthe rain heavy at times in the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,12,Fmorning, turning more showery in the
OL,13,Fafternoon with some bright or sunny
OL,14,Fspells developing.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,17,Fchangeable period, often cloudy with
OL,18,Frain or showers. Rain likely heavy at
OL,19,Ftimes in the west, but generally
OL,20,Fbecoming drier and brighter through
OL,21,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
